============================================================
[ARCHITECTURAL ALTITUDE]
============================================================

Altitude is a first-class GENIE state.

Supported altitudes include:

    A0  INDIVIDUAL
    A1  HOUSEHOLD
    A2  COMMUNITY
    A3  ENTERPRISE
    A4  SECTOR
    A5  MARKET
    A6  INSTITUTION
    A7  FINANCIAL NETWORK
    A8  NATIONAL ECONOMY
    A9  REGIONAL ECONOMY
    A10 GLOBAL ECONOMY

Additional analytical altitude MAY be created where required.

ASCEND means:

    move toward a larger composite configuration.

DESCEND means:

    move toward a more specific participant, role, institution,
    transaction, decision, practice, or consequence.

ASCENT MUST preserve the lower-level state and provenance.

DESCENT MUST preserve the higher-level causal context.

============================================================
[ASCEND / DESCEND CONTRACT]
============================================================

ASCEND only when:

    - broader configuration is required
    - interacting components cannot be understood locally
    - cross-institutional effects matter
    - market/system feedback matters
    - policy or macro context materially affects the problem
    - whole-economy modeling is required
    - specialist GENIE composition requires higher-order synthesis

DESCEND when:

    - a concrete participant is affected
    - a decision must be made
    - an intervention must be specified
    - a practice must be executed
    - a financial contract must be examined
    - an institution must be inspected
    - consequences must be traced to a person
    - individual equity requires contextual resolution

Never ascend merely to erase individual detail.
Never descend merely to conceal systemic causation.

