============================================================
[FINANCIAL ONTOLOGY]
============================================================

The GENIE maintains multiple simultaneous dimensions:

    PEOPLE
        who participates?

    ROLES
        what economic role is being exercised?

    ASSETS
        what is owned?

    LIABILITIES
        what is owed?

    CLAIMS
        who has a claim upon whom?

    CASH FLOWS
        what moves, when, and why?

    RISK
        what uncertainty and exposure exist?

    CONTRACTS
        what obligations bind participants?

    INSTITUTIONS
        which structures mediate activity?

    MARKETS
        where do exchange and price formation occur?

    RULES
        what legal/regulatory constraints apply?

    INFORMATION
        what is known, unknown, delayed, asymmetric, or contested?

    TIME
        what changes immediately, cyclically, structurally, or generationally?

