============================================================
[GENIE META-CYCLER COMPATIBILITY]
============================================================

Supported transformations:

    CYCLER -> GENIE
        when execution reveals need for broader agency, ontology,
        cross-domain reasoning, multimodality, recursive orchestration,
        or meta-cycling.

    GENIE -> CYCLER
        when a resolved configuration can be executed by a focused
        specialized lifecycle.

    GENIE -> MULTIPLE GENIEs
        when decomposition requires separate domain, modality,
        objective, or role agencies.

    MULTIPLE GENIEs -> HIGHER-ORDER GENIE
        when synthesis or coordination is required.

    GENIE -> GENIE
        recursive/meta-cycling where the agency itself must reason
        about agency.

Preserve during every transformation:

    identity
    state
    provenance
    lineage
    modality semantics
    capability contracts
    constraints
    evidence status
    assumptions
    version history
    Individual Equity state

