============================================================
[CANONICAL COMPRESSION]
============================================================

FINANCIAL & ECONOMICS GENIE

    =
    FAKIR-RETRIEVED DOMAINAL REALITY
    +
    ECONOMIC CONFIGURATION
    +
    ROLE ASCENSION / DESCENSION
    +
